Rule 4 (reduction_dimension must be -1 or a valid axis)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1 ∧ (v_2 = -1 ∨ (v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)))
